Explicitly audit one or all integrity boundaries of an existing grouped store

Usage: candidate01-release-cli verify <CHECK> [STORE]

Arguments:
  <CHECK>  [possible values: schema, metadata, hashes, model, fks, projection, all]
  [STORE]  

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

STORE defaults to XDG_DATA_HOME/vlajmaji/stores/default, falling back to HOME/.local/share/vlajmaji/stores/default. An explicit STORE overrides the environment. Verify only opens an existing store and never creates or downloads it. A named check certifies only that scope; `all` attempts every check. The default location is intended for a future dictionary-of-dictionaries; the initial Lensisku-only store is provisional.
